      "side": 1,
      "message": "Opinion: these regexes complicate the reading of these tests and the conciseness of the assertions.\n\nSuggested solution: We add the ability to stub out the temporary directory to os_steps.TempDir using the context. The mechanism would be similar to what we do for stubbing out a time.\n\nI realize this complicates things in that you need to land the fix in the infra repo and then roll in the change, but I think it will make these more maintainable and less boiler-plate-ery",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 127,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 127,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "c535c7fe631bbeaabbac8396da163375b1c6eb9b",
