      "writtenOn": "2023-09-01T16:38:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understand. Do you mean adding the ability to control the path returned by `os_steps.TempDir()` from tests using the context?\n\nIf so, I still need physical files to test this task driver (e.g. ZIP file extraction, directory contents scanning, etc.). Presumably these physical files would still live inside a temporary directory with a non-deterministic name (e.g. created by `t.TempDir()`), so the regular expressions would still be necessary.",
      "parentUuid": "a9a80fd5_08670cd0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 127,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 127,
        "endChar": 44
