      "writtenOn": "2023-09-01T17:33:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Something like;\n\n```\nfunc Test(t *testing.T) {\nworkDir :\u003d t.TempDir()\n...\nctx \u003d os_steps.OverrideTempDir(ctx, workDir)\n...\n\"--work-dir\", workDir,\n...\n```\n\nMake an actual temp dir, but then have os_steps return that instead of generating a new random one.\n\nThen, no regex should be required and we are more confident the right workdir is used in the right spot.",
